<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 0.590 pts off FTSE on Oct 28.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 0.590 pts off FTSE on Oct 28.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on October 28. Analysts estimate this will take 0.590 point off the FTSE 100.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>  * Redland Plc				  5.50  6.875   0.206</p>
<p>  * RMC Group Plc				7.80  9.750   0.146</p>
<p>  * Smith Industries			  10.60  13.25   0.238</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
